{"t":1794570064052,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"どうせ引き裂かれるなら、\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570064400,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"身を引き裂かされる方がはるかにマシだと思った。\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570071806,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"信じてた。\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570073937,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"…いや、信じてる。\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570077356,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"今この瞬間だって、信じてる。\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570082129,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"でも…薄々は気付いてる。\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570084799,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"信じたいのは、認めたくないだけだからだ。\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570086719,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"自分に言い聞かせるような、\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570088509,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"そんな涙声が…もうたまらなく馬鹿馬鹿しくて…。\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
