{"t":1794570096912,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"機械的に繰り返されていたそれはようやく収まり、とても静かになった。\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570104822,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"ひぐらしの声だけが…いやに騒がしい。\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570108314,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"なのに、\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570110340,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"…彼女のそれはまだ聞こえる気がする。\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570113637,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"…聞こえるはずはない。\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570116518,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"彼女はもう、言うのをやめているのだから。\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570121681,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"泣いているのは俺だけだった。\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570124770,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"彼女は泣きもしなかった。\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570129512,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"彼女がそれを繰り返し口にしていた時も、表情どころか感情もなかった。\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570133493,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"彼女に、俺のために流す涙がないのなら、\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570135672,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"俺にだって。\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570154136,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"…彼女らのために流す涙はいらないはずなのだ。\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570154137,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"それなのに…痛み、目を潤ませてしまうのは…どうして？\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570154137,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"それでも引き裂かれてないと、…信じていたいから。\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570157347,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"もう充分だろ？\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570160110,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"内なる、もうひとりの自分がやさしく語りかける…。\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570165567,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"俺はもう充分に心を痛めたさ。\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570168626,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"…そして何度も、その痛む心を捨てるべきかどうか迷ったんだ。\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570172501,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"だけど俺は…頑なに、捨てることを拒んだんじゃないか。\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570177989,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"捨てれば…もっと心が楽になれる…。\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570181701,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"それを知りながらも、俺は信じることを選んだんじゃないか。\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570185080,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"その辛かった苦労は、きっと俺にしかわからないし、俺にしかねぎらえない。\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570191069,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"なぁ俺。\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570194276,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"…俺は充分に頑張った。\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570197507,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"…俺がそれを認めてやる。\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570199735,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"だから。\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570202287,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"…もう楽になってもいいんじゃないか…？\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570207429,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"それに…捨てるんじゃない。\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570210479,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"彼女と一緒に、置いていくんだ。\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570214637,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"…花を手向けるように。\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570219324,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"さぁ。\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
{"t":1794570221813,"m":{"type":"hookSource","text":"…心を落ち着けて…。\n","sourceName":"TextController:TextController:::TextMesh:UIText:t:eshPro:Te","sourceCode":"EHMF3@Assembly-CSharp:Assets.Scripts.Core.TextWindow:TextController:SetText:4:JIT:UNITY"}}
